    {
      "id": "blk-0289",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "第四部分：简答题",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0290",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "答题技巧：每题写3到5条，每条写一句话。结合生活经验回答，不需要背教材原话。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0291",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第1题 请结合你的生活经验，说说“重复使用”和“升级再造”有什么区别，各举一个例子。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0292",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0293",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 重复使用是把东西原样再用一次，比如玻璃罐洗干净装调料。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0294",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 升级再造是把旧东西改造成价值更高的新东西，比如旧牛仔裤改成收纳袋。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0295",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 重复使用的关键是“不改变物品形态”，升级再造的关键是“创造新价值”。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0296",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 重复使用的例子：旧手机给老人用、快递箱装杂物。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0297",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 升级再造的例子：旧轮胎做秋千、旧毛衣拆了织成地毯。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0298",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第2题 你家里有没有“用了很久不舍得扔”的东西？请说说它为什么让你不舍得扔，从可持续设计角度分析。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0299",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0300",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 描述物品，比如用了10年的保温杯、奶奶的缝纫机。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0301",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 不舍得扔的原因：有感情、还能用、质量好。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0302",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 从情感化设计角度：产品承载了记忆和情感联结。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0303",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 从耐久性设计角度：产品质量好，经久耐用。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0304",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 从可持续设计角度：延长产品使用寿命就是减少资源消耗。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0305",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第3题 请举例说明你生活中遇到的“过度包装”现象，并说说你觉得应该怎么改进。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0306",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0307",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 举例：月饼盒里三层外三层、化妆品礼盒比产品还大。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0308",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 过度包装的问题：浪费材料、增加垃圾、增加运输能耗。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0309",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 改进方向：简化包装、用可回收材料、按需包装。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0310",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 消费者的态度：愿意为环保包装买单，反对华而不实。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0311",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 商家的责任：把包装成本用在产品品质上，而不是面子工程上。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0312",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第4题 你平时购物时，会考虑产品的“可持续性”吗？请说说你在哪些方面会做出环保选择。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0313",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0314",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 自带购物袋，不用一次性塑料袋。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0315",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 买补充装而不是买新瓶子。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0316",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 优先选可回收材料做的产品。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0317",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 买耐用产品，不买便宜但用不久的东西。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0318",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 二手平台买闲置物品，不追求全新。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0319",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第5题 请举例说明“共享经济”如何帮助实现可持续设计，并说说你体验过的共享服务。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0320",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0321",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 共享单车减少私家车和短途打车，降低碳排放。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0322",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 共享充电宝让很多人不用自己买充电宝。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0323",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 共享汽车减少汽车保有量，提高资源利用效率。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0324",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 共享图书、共享工具、共享办公空间等。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0325",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 共享经济的核心：用服务替代拥有，提高资源利用率。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0326",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第6题 你家的旧手机、旧电脑、旧家电是怎么处理的？请说说你觉得最环保的处理方式是什么。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0327",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0328",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 现状：有的闲置、有的卖掉、有的给亲戚用、有的扔掉。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0329",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 最环保的方式：先考虑给需要的人继续用。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0330",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 如果不能用了，送到正规回收点，不随便扔。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0331",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 回收后可以提取贵金属，减少资源开采。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0332",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 购买时选择可维修、可升级的产品，从源头减少电子垃圾。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0333",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第7题 请举例说明“向自然学习”的设计，并说说你从中得到的启发。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0334",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0335",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 例子：建筑外墙种植物降温、太阳能板、仿生结构。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0336",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 自然界没有废弃物，一切都在循环。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0337",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 自然界用可再生能源，太阳、风、水。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0338",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 自然界的材料可降解，不产生永久垃圾。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0339",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 启发：设计应该模仿自然的循环模式，而不是线性消耗模式。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0340",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第8题 如果让你设计一款“可持续的水杯”，你会从哪些方面考虑？请列出至少5点。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0341",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "参考思路：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0342",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第一条 材料：用可回收或可降解材料，比如竹纤维、不锈钢、玻璃。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0343",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第二条 耐久性：设计得结实耐用，不用频繁更换。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0344",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第三条 可维修性：杯盖、密封圈等易损件可以单独更换。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0345",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第四条 减量化：包装简洁，不用过度包装。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0346",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第五条 情感化：设计得好看好用，让人舍不得扔。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0347",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "第六条 可回收：产品报废后材料可以回收再利用。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
